<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Jardine group companies.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Jardine group companies.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it has launched 380 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Jardine group of companies.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:  Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd	0.1 shares</p>
<p> Jardine Strategic Holdings Ltd	0.1 shares</p>
<p> Hong Kong Land Holdings Ltd	  0.3 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.  STRIKE PRICE	 US$1.9400	 PREMIUM	 13.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.3518	 GEARING	 4.6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   29.APR.98	 MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     US$2.1090</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
